OL,3,CBluetongue virus rapidly spreading
OL,4,Camong sheep with heatwave to blame
OL,6,FScorching temperatures in parts of
OL,7,FEngland have helped the resurgence of
OL,8,Fa blue-tongue virus affecting farm
OL,9,Fanimals. West of England Reporter
OL,10,FSangita Lal reports from North Devon.
OL,12,FIn the middle of rolling brown in
OL,13,FNorth Devon, it's clear that the
OL,14,Fclimate is changing and affecting
OL,15,FBritain's landscape.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786162661
OL,3,CBluetongue virus rapidly spreading
OL,4,Camong sheep with heatwave to blame
OL,6,FBut successive heatwaves and more high
OL,7,Ftemperatures forecast aren't the only
OL,8,Fchallenges farmers face this summer;
OL,9,Fextreme weather has led to more midges
OL,10,Fbiting sheep and spreading the virus
OL,11,Fbluetongue.
OL,13,FBluetongue is a non-contagious, viral
OL,14,Fdisease affecting ruminants like
OL,15,Fsheep, cattle, goats, and deer.
OL,17,FIt is spread by biting midges, not by
OL,18,Fdirect animal contact.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786162661
OL,3,CBluetongue virus rapidly spreading
OL,4,Camong sheep with heatwave to blame
OL,6,FThe disease does not affect humans or
OL,7,Ffood safety, meaning meat and milk
OL,8,Fremain safe to consume.
OL,10,FDominic Elson keeps 100 native breeds
OL,11,Fof sheep at his farm.
OL,13,FThe North Ronaldsay is one of the
OL,14,Frarest sheep in the world. It has
OL,15,Fsurvived for centuries in the UK, but
OL,16,Fnow this one is struggling.
OL,18,F"We've only been really experiencing
OL,19,Fthis for about the last ten days, so
OL,20,Fwe're still really quite early in it,"
OL,21,FMr Elson said.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786162661
OL,3,CBluetongue virus rapidly spreading
OL,4,Camong sheep with heatwave to blame
OL,6,F"It could get really bad. The problem
OL,7,Fis that it's hitting rams worse than
OL,8,Fewes. Therefore, the rams are losing
OL,9,Ffertility.
OL,11,F"Very soon some farms will be putting
OL,12,Ftheir rams in in order to make sure
OL,13,Fthey have lambs next year, but the
OL,14,Frams may not be well enough. So this
OL,15,Factually has an economic hit."
OL,17,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,18,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,19,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,20,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786162661
OL,3,CBluetongue virus rapidly spreading
OL,4,Camong sheep with heatwave to blame
OL,6,FThere is some criticism among the
OL,7,Ffarming community about how available
OL,8,Fvaccines for the disease are.
OL,10,FMr Elson added: "We were able to get
OL,11,Fthe vaccine because we acted quickly.
OL,12,FAs of today, from what I understand,
OL,13,Fthere is now likely to be a shortage
OL,14,Fof the vaccine."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
