FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786162661
OL,3,CBluetongue virus rapidly spreading
OL,4,Camong sheep with heatwave to blame
OL,6,FThe Department for Environment, Food
OL,7,Fand Rural Affairs (DEFRA) said on
OL,8,FFriday: "We recognise this is an
OL,9,Fincredibly difficult time for animal
OL,10,Fkeepers who are on the frontline of
OL,11,Fthis disease, and we are monitoring
OL,12,Fthe situation closely.
OL,14,F"Farmers should continue to be
OL,15,Fvigilant and monitor their animals
OL,16,Ffrequently, reporting any suspicions
OL,17,Fof disease to APHA.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1786162661
OL,3,CBluetongue virus rapidly spreading
OL,4,Camong sheep with heatwave to blame
OL,6,F"We continue to work closely with
OL,7,Findustry and are putting processes in
OL,8,Fplace to bring in additional vaccine
OL,9,Fsupplies to help farmers to protect
OL,10,Ftheir livestock."
OL,12,FA few minutes after speaking with
OL,13,FDominic Elson, we drove back up to his
OL,14,Ffield to check on his flock - and
OL,15,Falready he noticed the virus had
OL,16,Fspread.
OL,18,FHe told me he had to bring in more of
OL,19,Fhis sheep because they were showing
OL,20,Fsymptoms of the virus.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
